  "prefLabel": "He-W 856.02 Treatment of Specific Types of Resources",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 856.02 Treatment of Specific Types of Resources. Funds from an individual development account used for unqualified purposes, pursuant to 42 USC 604(h), shall be treated as lump sum payment in accordance with He-W 656.04(b)(10), for the adult categories of medical assistance.\n\nSource. #12481, eff 2-21-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
